<title>FRANCE: Morocco seeks 30,000 T maize, 5,000 T barley-trade.</title>
<headline>Morocco seeks 30,000 T maize, 5,000 T barley-trade.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco is in the market to import 30,000 tonnes of optional-origin maize and 5,000 tonnes of optional-origin feed barley, European grain traders said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The maize is for December-January shipment and the barley for spot delivery, they said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
